---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import familyPhoto from '../assets/jake-family.jpg';
---

<section class="w-full max-w-[640px] mx-auto px-[var(--section-x)] py-[var(--section-y)] border-t border-gray-200">
  <h2 class="font-serif type-h2 mb-6 text-near-black">About</h2>
  <p class="font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-near-black prose-body mb-4">
    I'm Jake. I live in Orange County with my wife Kinsey and our four kids. I follow Jesus, and most of what I do flows from one conviction: faith isn't a Sunday compartment, it's how you show up Monday through Friday.
  </p>
  <p class="font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-near-black prose-body mb-4">
    My day job is leading <a href="https://searchnational.org/orange-county" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-inline">Search OC</a>, a ministry built around creating safe places for people to ask honest questions about God. I write <a href="https://hkc.beehiiv.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-inline">Having Killer Conversations</a> every Monday for people who want to get better at talking about faith in real life.
  </p>
  <p class="font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-near-black prose-body mb-8">
    Mostly though, I just like helping people figure this stuff out one conversation at a time. That's why my phone number is on this page.
  </p>
  <Image
    src={familyPhoto}
    alt="Jake with Kinsey and their four kids."
    width={600}
    height={400}
    loading="lazy"
    class="w-full rounded-2xl object-cover object-top shadow-md"
  />
</section>
